l_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23407", "diff_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23407.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23407.patch", "merged_at": "2026-09-09T04:22:51Z"}, "body": "Remove hamcrest from a subset of tests in the\n`org.apache.kafka.streams.processor.internals` package by migrating to\nJUnit assertions.\n\nReviewers: Chia-Ping Tsai <chia7712@gmail.com>\n", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/23407/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/23407/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": null, "score": 1.0}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/23636", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/23636/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/23636/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/23636/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23636", "id": 5642364631, "node_id": "PR_kwDOACG9q88AAAABF14bzg", "number": 23636, "title": "MINOR: Replace try/fail/catch with assertThrows in remaining Streams tests", "user": {"login": "sunm2n", "id": 134378502, "node_id": "U_kgDOCAJ0Bg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134378502?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/sunm2n", "html_url": "https://github.com/sunm2n", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sunm2n/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sunm2n/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sunm2n/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sunm2n/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sunm2n/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sunm2n/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sunm2n/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sunm2n/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sunm2n/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 820747028, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4MjA3NDcwMjg=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/streams", "name": "streams", "color": "63edea", "default": false, "description": null, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 1257747426, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWwxMjU3NzQ3NDI2", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/tests", "name": "tests", "color": "cfff60", "default": false, "description": "Test fixes (including flaky tests)", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7522931565, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwGbTbQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/ci-approved", "name": "ci-approved", "color": "ffffff", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 5, "created_at": "2026-09-30T06:56:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-15T07:43:34Z", "closed_at": "2026-10-15T07:43:33Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "draft": false, "pull_request": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/pulls/23636", "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23636", "diff_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23636.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23636.patch", "merged_at": "2026-10-15T07:43:33Z"}, "body": "Replace the remaining straightforward try/fail/catch exception\r\nassertions in the Streams tests with `assertThrows`, following #23277\r\nand #23389.\r\n\r\nIn #23389, streams.internals, streams.state.internals,\r\nstreams.processor.internals, and streams.integration were left unchanged\r\nbecause they overlapped with in-flight Hamcrest removal work.\r\nThe referenced PRs (#23307, #23386, and #23387) have since been merged,\r\nand KAFKA-21028 has been resolved. This PR covers the remaining\r\nstraightforward assertions in streams.state.internals,\r\nstreams.processor.internals, and streams.integration, along with those\r\nin streams.kstream.internals, streams.processor, and streams/test-utils.\r\n\r\nWhere the catch block checked the exception message, the `assertThrows`\r\nreturn value is used to keep that check. Descriptive `fail()` messages\r\nare kept, and generic ones are replaced with messages that name the\r\nrejected operation. Unused `fail` imports are removed.\r\n\r\nIn `FineGrainedAutoResetIntegrationTest`, only `builder.build()` is\r\nwrapped, because the overlapping source is rejected when the topology\r\nis built, not when `stream()` is called. In\r\n`TimeOrderedKeyValueBufferTest#shouldNotRestoreUnrecognizedVersionRecord`,\r\nthe `finally` block that cleans up the buffer is kept.\r\n\r\nLeft unchanged:\r\n- `GlobalStateTaskTest`: `fail()` is conditional on a test parameter,\r\n  so it is not a direct try/fail/catch.\r\n- `KafkaStreamsTest#shouldThrowTopologyExceptionOnEmptyTopology`: same\r\n  reason as in #23389 (the `fail()` sits inside try-with-resources).\r\n- `TimeOrderedKeyValueBufferTest` still imports `fail` for the\r\n  `default` branch of a switch in a callback.\r\n\r\nTesting:\r\n\r\n```sh\r\n./gradlew :streams:checkstyleTest :streams:spotlessCheck \\\r\n    :streams:test-utils:checkstyleTest :streams:integration-tests:checkstyleTest\r\n./gradlew :streams:test \\\r\n    --tests org.apache.kafka.streams.state.internals.CompositeReadOnlyWindowStoreTest \\\r\n    --tests org.apache.kafka.streams.state.internals.CompositeReadOnlySessionStoreTest \\\r\n    --tests org.apache.kafka.streams.state.internals.MaybeTest \\\r\n    --tests org.apache.kafka.streams.state.internals.TimeOrderedKeyValueBufferTest \\\r\n    --tests org.apache.kafka.streams.processor.internals.ProcessorContextImplTest \\\r\n    --tests org.apache.kafka.streams.processor.UsePartitionTimeOnInvalidTimestampTest \\\r\n    --tests org.apache.kafka.streams.kstream.internals.KStreamPeekTest \\\r\n    --tests org.apache.kafka.streams.kstream.internals.KTableTransformValuesTest\r\n./gradlew :streams:test-utils:test --tests org.apache.kafka.streams.MockProcessorContextTest\r\n./gradlew :streams:integration-tests:test \\\r\n    --tests org.apache.kafka.streams.integration.FineGrainedAutoResetIntegrationTest\r\n```\n\nReviewers: Ken Huang <s7133700@gmail.com>\n", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/23636/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/23636/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": null, "score": 1.0}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/23389", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/23389/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/23389/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/23389/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23389", "id": 5368615785, "node_id": "PR_kwDOACG9q88AAAABCcdOmg", "number": 23389, "title": "MINOR: Replace try/fail/catch with assertThrows in streams and kstream tests", "user": {"login": "DevJunz", "id": 143408530, "node_id": "U_kgDOCIw9kg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143408530?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/DevJunz", "html_url": "https://github.com/DevJunz", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/DevJunz/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/DevJunz/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/DevJunz/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/DevJunz/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/DevJunz/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/DevJunz/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/DevJunz/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/DevJunz/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/DevJunz/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 820747028, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4MjA3NDcwMjg=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/streams", "name": "streams", "color": "63edea", "default": false, "description": null, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 1257747426, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWwxMjU3NzQ3NDI2", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/tests", "name": "tests", "color": "cfff60", "default": false, "description": "Test fixes (including flaky tests)", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7522931565, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwGbTbQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/ci-approved", "name": "ci-approved", "color": "ffffff", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 2, "created_at": "2026-09-07T00:23:02Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T06:48:15Z", "closed_at": "2026-09-16T06:48:15Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "draft": false, "pull_request": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/pulls/23389", "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23389", "diff_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23389.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23389.patch", "merged_at": "2026-09-16T06:48:14Z"}, "body": "Replace the remaining straightforward try/fail/catch exception\nassertions in the `org.apache.kafka.streams` and\n`org.apache.kafka.streams.kstream` test packages with `assertThrows`,\nsame as #23277.\n\nWhere the catch block checked the exception message, the `assertThrows`\nreturn value is used to keep that check. Unused `fail` imports are\nremoved.\n\nPreserve descriptive failure messages from the original `fail()` calls\nand clarify generic messages to identify rejected operations and invalid\ninputs.\n\nFiles in `streams.internals`, `streams.state.internals`,\n`streams.integration`, and `streams.processor.internals` are left\nunchanged because they overlap with the in-flight Hamcrest removal work\n(#23307, #23386, #23387, and KAFKA-21028, which is in progress).\n`KafkaStreamsTest#shouldThrowTopologyExceptionOnEmptyTopology` is also\nleft as is, since its `fail()` sits inside a try-with-resources block\nthat closes the `KafkaStreams` instance.\n\nTesting:\n\nValidated on Windows with Java 25 and Gradle 9.7.1. All 426 tests in the\nseven affected test classes passed, along with Streams Checkstyle and\nSpotless checks.\n\nEquivalent Gradle wrapper commands:\n\n```sh\n./gradlew :streams:checkstyleMain :streams:checkstyleTest\n:streams:spotlessCheck\n./gradlew :streams:test \\\n    --tests org.apache.kafka.streams.TopologyTest \\\n    --tests org.apache.kafka.streams.StreamsConfigTest \\\n    --tests org.apache.kafka.streams.KafkaStreamsTest \\\n    --tests org.apache.kafka.streams.kstream.TimeWindowsTest \\\n    --tests org.apache.kafka.streams.kstream.JoinWindowsTest \\\n    --tests org.apache.kafka.streams.kstream.SessionWindowsTest \\\n    --tests org.apache.kafka.streams.kstream.NamedTest\n```\n\nReviewers: Ken Huang <s7133700@gmail.com>\n", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/23389/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/23389/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": null, "score": 1.0}], "search_type": "lexical", "_fetched_at": "2026-11-03T17:42:00Z", "_query": "KAFKA-21028 is:pr"}